### Add photo 1 to listing 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/listings/1/photos
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://picsum.photos/id/1018/800/600"
}

### Add photo 2 to listing 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/listings/1/photos
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://picsum.photos/id/1025/800/600"
}

### Invalid URL (expected 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/listings/1/photos
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "not-a-link"
}

### Photos of listing 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/listings/1/photos

### Photos of a missing listing (expected 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/listings/999/photos

### Delete photo 1 from listing 1
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/listings/1/photos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}